<https://vocabs.dariah.eu/bbt/Concept/0000065> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Personen"@de <https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/thesaurus> .
<https://vocabs.dariah.eu/bbt/Concept/0000065> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "people"@en <https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/thesaurus> .
<https://vocabs.dariah.eu/bbt/Concept/0000065> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "This term classifies persistent roles and qualities of individual persons or groups of persons as a whole, mostly acquired at some time, sometimes even from birth on, that may or may not be lost at some later phase. They may pertain to qualities of general behaviour, intellectual or bodily abilities, skills and professions, social agency and status, economic position, cultural identity, religious or philosophical convictions and mindsets, states of health or psychological disposition."@en <https://w3id.org/uibk/inventaria/thesaurus> .
